// Two chasms, two stones, two blooms in sequence.
name Two Blooms
rule B1234/S012345678
steps 2
hint Two chasms, two stones, two seeds. Grow the first bloom to cross, plant on the second stone, press R to rewind, stand clear, then grow them both. The door opens only when both are exact.
tip Rewind clears the growth but keeps every planted seed. Wait on the far rock, away from both stones, before the second Grow.
intro Two beginnings, two crossings. Whoever came this way before carried two seeds and knew where to stand.
outro Two seeds, two bridges. Nothing that grows stays small.
